<title>GERMANY: Viag says Allianz owns over 5pct of shares.</title>
<headline>Viag says Allianz owns over 5pct of shares.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Allianz AG owns a stake of more than five percent in the diversified utility group Viag AG, Viag said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Viag said it had been informed by Allianz that the insurance group held voting rights on 5.91 percent of its shares.</p>
<p>German law requires companies to declare stakeholdings once they exceed five percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
